message: "If you reference this software, please cite it using these metadata. A Zenodo DOI is added at the first release."
title: "bci-membrane-latch: a toy fail-closed OES-32 residual gate between synthetic EEG-like signal quality and hologram intents"
abstract: >-
  Toy simulation (SYNTHETIC data only) of a fail-closed latch that fires one of four hologram UI
  intents only when the OES-32 residual R = max|x - x_ref| is within tolerance and a stub decoder
  is confident. Synthetic EEG-like signals only; no real EEG is read. Not a medical device and not
  for diagnosis or treatment; no health claims are made.
